    "created_at": "2018-10-15T08:04:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-10-15T08:04:04Z",
    "body": "The scenario is mostly about parsing URLs found in HTML and such. You could probably do some error signaling out-of-band, e.g., the developer console found in browsers, but that might not be relevant to everyone.\r\n\r\nAlso, note that this isn't about changing the default. This is solely about providing a wrapper, but it does seem that nobody has really been requesting this, so wontfixing might be fine.",
