    "updated_at": "2024-03-14T09:03:44Z",
    "body": "I like that idea, but I suspect a separate method would be better if we ever decided to do that as URL parsers are highly optimized and you'd probably want a separate code path for the detailed error URL parser. Or at least allow for the possibility of one.",
